==Serbo-Croatian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{qualifier|Ijekavian}}: {{l|sh|pjȅsma}}

===Etymology===
From earlier *{{term||pěsma|lang=sh}}, by assimilation p-n > p-m from {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{term/t|sla-pro|*pěsnь}}. The original stem has been preserved in archaic {{term|pjȅsan|lang=sh}} as well as old derivations such as {{term|pjȅsnīk|lang=sh}}/{{term|pȅsnīk|lang=sh}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/pêsma/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|pes|ma}}

